* Test circuit for the solver's MOSFET (tools/spice/cases/cmos.py; docs/circuit/solver-mosfet.md),
* not a part of the TR-909: two 4069UB inverters (models.cir's 4069UB_N and 4069UB_P) on the
* supply vdd, both driven by vin. A is unloaded but for 10 nF (its transfer curve and, through
* the 1 ohm Rdd, its supply current); B drives 100 nF to ground and 10k to vdd/2 (two 20k), so a
* square on vin shows its output current in both directions, saturated and linear.
* Inputs: vdd, vin (volts). Outputs: outa, outb, idd (A's supply current, volts per amp).
Vdd vdd 0 input vdd
Vin in 0 input vin
Rdd vdd vdda 1
MPA outa in vdda 4069UB_P
MNA outa in 0 4069UB_N
CA outa 0 10n
MPB outb in vdd 4069UB_P
MNB outb in 0 4069UB_N
CB outb 0 0.1u
RBP outb vdd 20k
RBN outb 0 20k
.output outa outa
.output outb outb
.output idd vdd vdda
